---
layout: base.njk
title: News
description: Reports from our outreaches across the Amenfi East Municipality.
permalink: /news/index.html
---
<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="crumbs"><a href="/">Home</a> &rsaquo; News</p>
    <h1>Reports from the field.</h1>
    <p>What we did, where, and who it reached. Every outreach is written up here with photographs.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec">
  <div class="wrap">
    {% if collections.posts.length %}
    <div class="post-list">
      {% for post in collections.posts %}
      <article>
        {% if post.data.cover %}<img class="thumb" src="{{ post.data.cover }}" alt="{{ post.data.coverAlt }}">
        {% else %}<div class="thumb photo photo-light"><span>PHOTO</span>No cover image yet.</div>{% endif %}
        <p class="tag">{{ post.data.category }}</p>
        <h3><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a></h3>
        <p>{{ post.data.standfirst }}</p>
        <p style="margin-top:auto;padding-top:.9rem"><time datetime="{{ post.data.date | isoDate }}">{{ post.data.date | readableDate }}</time></p>
      </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    {% else %}
    <p class="lede">No reports published yet.</p>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</section>
